.TH fesco-chair 1 2026-08-11 "sandogasa 0.19.2" "Sandogasa Manual"
.SH NAME
fesco\-chair \- FESCo meeting chair helper — agenda email, day\-of script, summary email
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfesco\-chair\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
FESCo meeting chair helper — agenda email, day\-of script, summary email
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH COMMANDS
.SS fesco-chair agenda
\fBfesco\-chair agenda\fR [\fB\-\-date\fR] [\fB\-\-voted\fR] [\fB\-\-followup\fR] [\fB\-\-new\fR] [\fB\-\-docs\fR] [\fB\-\-history\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Compose the meeting announcement email from the tracker
.TP
\fB\-\-date\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
Meeting date (default: the coming Tuesday)
.TP
\fB\-\-voted\fR \fI<N>\fR
Force ticket(s) into Discussed and Voted (repeat/CSV)
.TP
\fB\-\-followup\fR \fI<N>\fR
Force ticket(s) into Followups (repeat/CSV)
.TP
\fB\-\-new\fR \fI<N>\fR
Force ticket(s) into New business (repeat/CSV)
.TP
\fB\-\-docs\fR \fI<N>\fR
Add fesco/docs issue/PR(s) to the agenda (repeat/CSV)
.TP
\fB\-\-history\fR \fI<N>\fR
Past meetings scanned for followups (default 12)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print progress to stderr
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS fesco-chair config
\fBfesco\-chair config\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Store the Forgejo API token (interactive)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS fesco-chair script
\fBfesco\-chair script\fR [\fB\-\-date\fR] [\fB\-\-voted\fR] [\fB\-\-followup\fR] [\fB\-\-new\fR] [\fB\-\-docs\fR] [\fB\-\-history\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Day\-of checklist plus the meetbot command script
.TP
\fB\-\-date\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
Meeting date (default: the coming Tuesday)
.TP
\fB\-\-voted\fR \fI<N>\fR
Force ticket(s) into Discussed and Voted (repeat/CSV)
.TP
\fB\-\-followup\fR \fI<N>\fR
Force ticket(s) into Followups (repeat/CSV)
.TP
\fB\-\-new\fR \fI<N>\fR
Force ticket(s) into New business (repeat/CSV)
.TP
\fB\-\-docs\fR \fI<N>\fR
Add fesco/docs issue/PR(s) to the agenda (repeat/CSV)
.TP
\fB\-\-history\fR \fI<N>\fR
Past meetings scanned for followups (default 12)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print progress to stderr
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS fesco-chair summary
\fBfesco\-chair summary\fR [\fB\-\-date\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Compose the post\-meeting summary email from the minutes
.TP
\fB\-\-date\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
Meeting date (default: today)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print progress to stderr
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
